    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'18PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 18.06.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.\n\nThe allotment of land called as Galgahaowita in extent of about0.0102 Hectare, depicted as Lot \u2018A\u2019 in the Advance Tracing No. GA/NYG/2017/903 and dated 11.10.2017, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Pitigala (F.V.P. 592) in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Niyagama in Galle District in SouthernProvince and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Galgahaovita \u2013 Extent: About 0.0102 HectareNorth: Galgahaovita claimed by W. D. M. Pradeep; East:Galgahaovita claimed by W. D. M. Pradeep; South: Road andGalgahaovita claimed by W. D. M. Pradeep; West: Galgahaovitaclaimed by W. D. M. Pradeep.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/9/2014/WS/227.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.25th October, 2018.\n\n07 \u2013 31\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2128$10 \u2013 2019 cqks 18 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod \u2013 2019'06'18No. 2128/10 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 18, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act."
