    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'18PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 18.06.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2128$11 \u2013 2019 cqks 18 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod \u2013 2019'06'18No. 2128/11 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 18, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 30305 \u2013 31 (06/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed fora public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.\n\nFollowing lands name, Lots and extent depicted in Advance TracingNo. Co/DSO/2017/726 dated 11.12.2017, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Malambe (within the MunicipalCouncil limits of Kaduwela) in 476A, Malambe West Grama NiladhariDivision within the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kaduwela inColombo District, Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 01 \u2013 Galabadakumbura \u2013 Extent : About 0.2199HectareNorth: New Kandy Road and land bearing Assmt. No. 320/G atKaduwela Road; East: Land bearing Assmt. No. 320/G at KaduwelaRoad and canal; South: Canal and land bearing Assmt. No. 388/6 atKaduwela Road; West: Land bearing Assmt. No. 388/6 at KaduwelaRoad."
