    "chunk_text": "North: TP 92401, TP 78765, Lot 4 in PP mada/2941, Path andTP 78767; East: TP 78765, Lot 4 in PP mada/2941, path and TP78767, TP 86585; South: TP78767, TP 86585 and TP 92401;West: TP 86585, TP 92401 and TP 78765.\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'21PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.06.20192A\n\nparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation andthe details of the computation of such amount.\n\nU. UTHAYASHRITHER,Divisional Secretary,Kattankudy Division.\n\nDivisional Secretary's Office,Kattankudy,17th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 129\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: LAN/KWWDP/TP/-PS/01.\n\nMinistry of Lands Reference No.: 4-3/2016/WS/534.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intendsto acquire the following lands which are required for a publicpurpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be acquired:\n\nAllotment of land shown as Lot Nos. 1, 3, 4 in Total extent ofabout 0.8439 Hectare, depicted in preliminary No. PP/mada/2941, prepared by the surveyor General, situated in the villageof Kattankudy - 167B, in Divisional Secretary's Division ofKattankudy in Batticaloa District and bounded as follows.\n\nLot No. 1 \u2013 Name of Land: Alenodey; Description: WaterHole; Claimant: M. M. A. Aleem, No. 18, C. C. M. Mawatha,Kattankudy; Extent: 0.0085 Hectare.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nNorth: TP 78896 and TP 92403; East and South: Lot 2; West:Lot 2, TP 78896 and TP 92403.\n\nLot No. 2 \u2013 Name of Land: State Land; Extent: 0.0446Hectare.\n\nLot No. 3 \u2013 Name of Land: Alenodey; Description: WaterHole; Claimant: M. M. A. Aleem, No. 18, C. C. M. Mawatha,Kattankudy; Extent: 0.0328 Hectare."
