    "chunk_text": "Lot No. 2 \u2013 Name of Land: State Land; Extent: 0.0446Hectare.\n\nLot No. 3 \u2013 Name of Land: Alenodey; Description: WaterHole; Claimant: M. M. A. Aleem, No. 18, C. C. M. Mawatha,Kattankudy; Extent: 0.0328 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 4 \u2013 Name of Land: Alenodey; Description: Garden,contain 82 Coconut trees over 10 years old, 14 palmyra treesover 10 years old, 03 Mango trees over 10 years old, threepermanent buildings, a masonary well, a toilet and two pits;Claimant: M. M. A. Aleem, No. 18, C. C. M. Mawatha,Kattankudy; Extent: 0.7580 Hectare.\n\nNorth: Lot 3 and Beach Road; East: Beach Road, TP 92402,TP 78896, Path and TP 78767; South: TP 92402, TP 78896,Path, TP 78767 and TP 78765; West: TP 78767 and TP 78765.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid lands on which aservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Kattankudy, Divisional Secretariat, Kattankudy on the 21stday of August 2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 10th dayof July, 2019 the nature of their interes in the land, the particularsof their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the saidland/servitude, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.\n\nU. UTHAYASHRITHER,Divisional Secretary,Kattankudy Division.\n\nDivisional Secretary's Office,Kattankudy,17th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 130"
