    "chunk_text": "NOW THEREFORE, I, Suranga Ambagahathenne, Returning Officer of Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha, acting interms of Section 66B(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) as amended by Local AuthoritiesElection (amended) Act, No. 16 of 2017 do hereby declare Mathara Arachchige Jayaweera elected as vice chairman ofthe Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nSURANGA AMBAGAHATHENNE,Returning Officer,Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Ratnapura,20th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 194/2\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichKekanadura Vidana Arachchige Chandrasiri the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1)(a) of theaforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that 5 Gangeyaya of Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs tosuch party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declaredelected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Paththini Wickramarachchige Nimal Kumarasingha to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Suranga Ambagahathenne, Returning Officer of the Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha, actingin terms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that PaththiniWickramarachchige Nimal Kumarasingha was elected as the member of the 5 Gangeyaya of Embilitpitiya PradeshiyaSabha.\n\nSURANGA AMBAGAHATHENNE,Returning Officer,Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Ratnapura,20th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 194/3\n\nIV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'24Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.06.20193A"
