    "chunk_text": "07 - 194/3\n\nIV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'24Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.06.20193A\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of loss of seat oroffice ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichMeegasdeniya Kankanamge Amil the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1)(a) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon the member of that 8 Walalgoda of Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs to such partyand is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared elected asa member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Semage Chandrarathna Kurukula to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Suranga Ambagahathenne, Returning Officer of the Embilitpitiya Pradeshiya Sabha, actingin terms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that SemageChandrarathna Kurukula was elected as the member of the 8 Walalgoda of Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha\n\nSURANGA AMBAGAHATHENNE,Returning Officer,Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Ratnapura,20th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 194/4\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
